{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合上頓悟要論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱慧海，建州人，依越大雲寺道智和尚受業。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼云：是即\n沒交涉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具梵語薩婆曷剌他悉陀，中國翻云\n一切義成。舊云悉達多，猶是訛略具語。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出聯燈會要"}
